<view class="safe-page"><top-header title="手机号登录" subtitle="账号与收藏同步" showBack="{{true}}"/><view class="page-content">
<view class="panel"><view class="title">微信一键手机号登录</view><view class="muted">正式版由用户点击授权后读取手机号，不会静默获取。</view><button class="primary-btn" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="phoneLogin" disabled="{{busy}}">微信手机号一键登录</button><view class="muted gap">当前微信主体能力未配置时会明确提示不可用。</view></view>
<view class="panel"><view class="title">验证码登录</view><view class="muted">验证码由服务端配置决定；开发测试码不发送短信、不证明手机号所有权。</view><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="changePhone"/><view class="code-row"><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="验证码" value="{{code}}" bindinput="changeCode"/><button class="secondary-btn code-btn" bindtap="getCode" disabled="{{busy}}">获取验证码</button></view><view wx:if="{{challenge.debugCode}}" class="hint">测试码：{{challenge.debugCode}} · 5分钟有效</view><checkbox-group bindchange="toggleAgree"><label class="agree"><checkbox value="yes"/>我同意登录及隐私说明；若使用测试码，则仅用于开发联调，不证明手机号所有权</label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy||!challenge||!agreed}}">登录 / 注册</button></view>
</view><bottom-nav active="me"/></view>
